"**Dynamic Loading**: Tools are loaded only when first requested and "
"cached for subsequent calls, minimizing memory usage."
msgstr "**动态加载**：工具仅在首次请求时加载，并在后续调用中进行缓存，从而最大限度地减少内存使用。"

